<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine peso ends up on higher interest rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine peso ends up on higher interest rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------- April 21------------------------</p>
<p>	     *Peso average at 26.362 from 26.364</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The Philippine peso closed firmer on Monday on rising T-bill rates and relatively higher dollar supplies after market players returned from their weekend convention, dealers said.</p>
<p>The peso ended at 26.361 from 26.369. Volume was higher at $131.5 million from $81.5 million.</p>
<p>&quot;The dollar was artificially high last Friday because it was a thin market,&quot; a dealer said.</p>
